From b43d80dd2e0aa732732768f9bbaa4642ffb6b4d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/24] board: qualcomm: report the EVK as unlocked to fastboot

getvar unlocked fails with "Variable not implemented": fb_getvar
returns the fastboot.unlocked environment variable when it is set and
has no handler of its own for "unlocked".

This U-Boot has no lock state and flashes any partition, so say so.

Signed-off-by: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [no lock state; qcom-next 04d89df5c2 adds one backed by the OP-TEE AVB TA and an frp partition]
---
 board/qualcomm/default.env | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/board/qualcomm/default.env b/board/qualcomm/default.env
index e7ecb6c..121fe17 100644
--- a/board/qualcomm/default.env
+++ b/board/qualcomm/default.env
@@ -9,3 +9,4 @@ bootmenu_1=Enable fastboot mode=run fastboot
 bootmenu_2=Reset device=reset
 menucmd=bootmenu
 bootcmd=run do_boot
+fastboot.unlocked=yes
-- 
2.43.0

